dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "Path Playback",
  "description": "Maps+ path playback: three cars on one clock, so all markers move together.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_map_1": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "Playback rows: 3 cars, one hour",
      "options": {
        "query": "| inputlookup playback_demo_tracks.csv | eval description=\"car \".track_id, tooltip=description, markerVisibility=\"hidden\", pathColor=case(track_id=16, \"#e50de5\", track_id=17, \"#0003F0\", track_id=208, \"#D43C29\") | sort 0 track_id _time | table _time latitude longitude track_id description tooltip pathColor markerVisibility",
        "queryParameters": {
          "earliest": "-24h@h",
          "latest": "now"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "inputs": {},
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_html": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "Three cars drive at a steady speed for the same hour (09:00 to 10:00 on 17 November 2026), and every car has a point at the same minute, so pressing **Play** moves all three markers together straight away. Use this map to check that playback works.\n\n- **Play / pause:** the play button (bottom left). The slider scrubs through the hour and the date control shows the current playback time.\n- **Speed:** **Tick Length** (1000 ms here) and **Playback Speed** (60 here) under **Format > Path Lines > Playback**, so the hour plays in about one minute. Playback runs at Speed times real time, but its timer fires every Tick Length / Speed ms and browsers won't go below about 4 ms, so keep Tick Length / Speed at 10 or more. With the default Tick Length of 50, any Speed above about 12 has no effect.\n- **Per path:** right-click a path to add it to, or remove it from, playback. Right-click the map to add all, clear all or reset. From SPL, `| eval playback=\"false\"` turns playback off for a path.\n- The moving marker takes its icon, prefix and colour from the `icon`, `prefix` and `pathColor` fields."
      }
    },
    "viz_map_1": {
      "type": "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus",
      "title": "Path playback",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_map_1"
      },
      "options": {
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.allPopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.animate": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoomDelay": "500",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMaps": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsLabelLanguage": "en-US",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsTileLayer": "CanvasLight",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.cluster": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.contextMenu": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.criticalThreshold": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.defaultHeight": "600",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoom": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldown": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldownAction": "dblclick",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.fullScreen": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesPosition": "topleft",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesSearch": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesZoomLevel": "12",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapBlur": "15",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapColorGradient": "{\"0.4\":\"blue\",\"0.6\":\"cyan\",\"0.7\":\"lime\",\"0.8\":\"yellow\",\"1\":\"red\"}",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapEnable": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMaxPointIntensity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMinOpacity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapOnly": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapRadius": "25",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.i18nLanguage": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControlCollapsed": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLat": "-10.9035",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLon": "-37.0610",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterZoom": "14",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapTile": "http://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/light_all/{z}/{x}/{y}.png",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxClusterRadius": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxSpiderfySize": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxZoom": "19",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureActiveColor": "#00ff00",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureCompletedColor": "#0066ff",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureIconPosition": "topright",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureLocalization": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryAreaUnit": "acres",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryLengthUnit": "feet",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryAreaUnit": "sqmiles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryLengthUnit": "miles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureTool": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathIdentifier": "track_id",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "30",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.playbackSpeed": "60",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.playbackTickLength": "1000",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.renderer": "canvas",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlayback": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlaybackDateControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlaybackPlayControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPlaybackSliderControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.useOpenFreeMap": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maplibreStylePreset": "positron"
      }
    },
    "viz_md_1": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "### Playback: three cars, one hour\n\n**What this shows** - Three cars driving at the same time, on different routes through the same part of town. Each car has 61 points, one per minute from 09:00 to 10:00 on 17 November 2026, so **Play** moves all three markers together and they keep moving for the whole hour.\n\n**The SPL**\n\n```spl\n| inputlookup playback_demo_tracks.csv\n| eval description=\"car \".track_id, tooltip=description, markerVisibility=\"hidden\", pathColor=case(track_id=16, \"#e50de5\", track_id=17, \"#0003F0\", track_id=208, \"#D43C29\")\n| sort 0 track_id _time\n| table _time latitude longitude track_id description tooltip pathColor markerVisibility\n```\n\n**How it works**\n\n1. `playback_demo_tracks.csv` ships with the app. It was made from three real trips (cars 16, 17 and 208) in the app's `go_track_trackspoints.csv` lookup: stopped and parked GPS points were dropped, and each route was resampled to 61 points at equal distances along it. That gives a steady speed of about 55 to 70 m a minute, so the markers move from the first second with no pauses.\n2. All three cars use the same 61 timestamps (`2026-11-17T09:00:00` to `2026-11-17T10:00:00`, ISO format), so they start, move and stop together.\n3. `eval` adds the popup and tooltip text, a colour per car, and `markerVisibility=\"hidden\"` so only the paths and the moving markers show.\n4. `sort 0 track_id _time` puts each path in time order. Maps+ never sorts rows itself.\n5. Options: `showPathLines=1` and `pathIdentifier=track_id` build one path per car; `showPlayback=1` adds every path to playback; the date, play and slider controls are switched on with `showPlaybackDateControl`, `showPlaybackPlayControl` and `showPlaybackSliderControl`; `playbackSpeed=60` with `playbackTickLength=1000` plays the hour in about a minute.\n\n**Field formats and rules**\n\n| Field | Expected format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `latitude`, `longitude` | decimal degrees | Exact lowercase names. Every row is a path vertex. |\n| `_time` | a timestamp Maps+ can parse (ISO `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS` is safest) | Playback advances along it. It is read in the viewer's browser time zone. Rows must already be in time order within each path. |\n| `track_id` | any text; the field named in `pathIdentifier` | Splits rows into paths. Without `pathIdentifier`, all rows form one path. |\n| `description`, `tooltip` | HTML text | Popup and hover text; a path takes them from its first row. |\n| `pathColor` | CSS colour | Colour of the path and its moving marker. A path's style comes from its first row. |\n| `markerVisibility` | `\"true\"` / `\"marker\"` shows; anything else hides | Hides the static marker on every vertex, so only the paths and the moving markers show. |\n| `playback` | `\"true\"` / `\"false\"` per row | Not set here; the `showPlayback` option applies. A per-row `\"false\"` leaves that path out of playback. |\n\n**Try it**\n\n- Add `, playback=if(track_id=208, \"false\", \"true\")` to the `eval`: only cars 16 and 17 move.\n- Give car 17 a ten-minute head start: add `| eval _time=if(track_id=17, strftime(strptime(_time, \"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S\") - 600, \"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S\"), _time)` before `sort`.\n- Use your own data: any search that returns `latitude`, `longitude`, `_time` and an id field in time order plays back the same way. Timestamps that line up across ids make the markers move together.\n\n**Basemap:** keyless OpenFreeMap vector tiles (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1). CARTO basemaps need a free API key: see **Help > Basemaps & API keys**."
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "globalInputs": [],
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 980,
          "display": "auto",
          "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "viz_html",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 260
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map_1",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 260,
              "w": 880,
              "h": 720
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_md_1",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 880,
              "y": 260,
              "w": 560,
              "h": 720
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
